# Thousands of closure labels on one key, each label capturing a closure
# of that key, so the key is on a cycle of captures and its sum holds every
# label: the label solve once did work in the product of its points and
# its labels, and a sum of more labels than a cell's header has tags must
# compile as any other. Compiled at its size and at twice it, no count of
# the compiler's work grows faster than the program.
step_limit=120
. "$IDRIS_MLIR_ROOT/harness/testutils.sh"
scale_relation labels
